# Belt and braces. Each project carries its own .gitignore covering these
# relative to itself; these patterns catch them at any depth, so a file can
# never ride along just because it sat one level lower than expected.
**/.env
**/config/classes.yaml
**/data/
**/.venv/
**/__pycache__/
**/*.pyc
**/.pytest_cache/
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
